   "user": "patcon",
   "message": "oh hey, yeah! it's all happening in the browser, so that's totally doable! I'll prob need to rethink UI soon, as it's getting very messy, but aside from that \"draw your own\" idea, another one I wanted to add was ability to click a digit and visually highlight its specific edges that drive the dynamics (neighbors, mid-near edges, far edges), and maybe show the digits on the other side of those edges 🤔",
